al_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.3.stable, 4.4.stable, 4.5.beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.5186) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 15.35 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `Input.get_last_mouse_screen_velocity` in `_physics_process`, it seems to return the difference between the current mouse position and the mouse position when the program started (roughly - when not moving the mouse, the returned value is not zero and it also jumps around). It doesn't return the velocity.\n\n`Input.get_last_mouse_velocity()` works correctly.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea6ec022-04dd-4028-86d0-faa926c437d8)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the example project. Move the mouse. See that the mouse screen velocity showing in the label is wrong.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20917664/project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User",